**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
# Incremental-build stamps. These are composite-project state pointing at a dist/
# that .dockerignore strips, so a copied-in one makes tsc emit nothing and exit 0 —
# a silent no-op that leaves the image without @hame/shared/dist.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.vitest
